	(text "Charger and on/off switch.\n\nSwitch: SW1 drives only the Q1 gate. Base = GND = ON.\n2.2M gate pull-up = off when floating (1.9 uA through the ON switch)\n10k + 22nF soft-start limits inrush into the Walter bulk caps."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 95.758 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "14bc07ae-cc72-5b69-ab3c-b43cb9457499")
	)
	(text "Charger BQ25185DLHR: ISET 604R = 497 mA fast charge. \nILIM/VSET 18k = 500 mA input limit, 4.20 V (13k DNP = 1.1 A).\nTS unused: 10k to GND. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 209.296 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2b18320c-c862-5bd8-83a3-58864ce22c4d")
	)
	(text "Test Points"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 193.548 97.536 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "53560cc5-da60-4d35-8536-4d98f712ed33")
	)
	(text "Battery + Fuel Gauge\n\nBattery: J2 (pin 1 = +)\n\nFuel gauge U10 MAX17048.\nBefore the switch to track while off, ~3 uA\nI2C1 (ACC_*), addr 0x36. QSTRT and CTG low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109.728 96.774 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a62553f5-b89c-5dc1-ba14-0a970e848782")
	)
	(text "USB-C: vertical GCT USB4235-03-C (J1), 6.5 mm tall. CC1/CC2 5.1k to GND (UFP).\nD+/D- A and B pads joined at the connector, through the TVS D4 to the bridge U5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "acd81c8e-6f47-57fa-91d5-c4450091ca6f")
	)
	(text "VBUS detect; enabls U6.\n56k/100k divider for\n5V -> 3.2V level conversion\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 136.652 17.526 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b419623c-17a4-54da-9b42-132509964316")
	)
	(text "3.3 V always-on rail: TPS62840DLCR buck from SYS_SW, 2.2uH, 10uF in/out.\nVSET 267k = 3.3 V.\nMODE low = power-save (DNP 0R to 3V3 can force PWM)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 188.214 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e7292073-d95d-54a7-9d6a-809abfc1223f")
	)
